/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 44 0 R
/E (where Iph,ref is the photocurrent under standard test conditions \(STC\), \(G\) is the actual irradiance, and Gref=1000 W/m^2. Therefore, an increase in irradiance primarily increases the output current of the PV module, while the output voltage changes only slightly.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
