/E (The Maximum Power Point Tracking \(MPPT\) controller employed in this model is based on the Incremental Conductance  algorithm combined with a discrete integral regulator to ensure accurate and stable tracking of the maximum power point \(MPP\) under varying irradiance and temperature conditions. The controller continuously measures the photovoltaic \(PV\) array voltage Vpv and current Ipv, and determines the operating point relative to the MPP by evaluating the slope of the PV power-voltage characteristic.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
